t=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Q5CRkHUZz4sQ7kNvwHDQmqZ&_nc_oc=AdpbeLdOP4jXy4BqvdB4BiZVuTmtj_hnUhTjySVjUnswlsFj0rQr_ponZHKBqWc05Ts&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQaBEmbKJpxJwI4kXYF-ILyOjjiiJMjvWr2DYcJnhrhnQ&oe=6AF9D887"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot 4.png", "id": "1512781303346635", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499305050_1512781306679968_8311265691607344888_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=o4HHyVLlNwsQ7kNvwF52tki&_nc_oc=AdryCdwvHcIlOH0LkCvVw_VrUB10vaSdcOth4Mft8wOdJM3eVPj6bbVqWUNz5MhA5KE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSV-qoeLjSIpzvFHHW9SggQUTsGcyBTb5X5ySrITLkdPQ&oe=6AF9B60D"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "2560x1440 copy.png", "id": "4351475101785831", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491828038_4351475105119164_1853464437308931599_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=uO8PeRiA9WEQ7kNvwEEREu9&_nc_oc=AdqZBDN4BI5O1rhWPR5GjGOP2D1NfyfnomlkwOQMeolrlxeftv0Lpphuvpf-WVOlVTs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRs95YY6C_5N8TVZ6MDB-u-q-73mPaNd-7_UeEQn_OMBA&oe=6AF9DFB8"}, "display_name": "PutterVR", "keywords": ["golf"], "long_description": "# Lower Your Scores From Your Living Room\n**Free to try for 3 days.** Everything unlocked. Then one in-app purchase to keep playing. No subscription.\n\n**Three ways to play:**\n- **Launch Monitor:** putt a real ball - we read its true speed and line, then roll it out on a replica green with real break. Nothing to attach. Requires a putting mat or similar surface.\n- **Mixed Reality:** putt a virtual ball while still seeing your room and your feet (optional mount).\n- **Virtual Reality:** full immersion (optional mount).\n\nThe optional mount puts your controller on your own putter so the stroke is measured too.\n\n**Drills with a purpose.** Distance control, start line, aim, setup, pressure putting.\n\n**Championship courses.** 72 replica holes on greens from the courses the pros compete on every week.\n\n**Physics you can trust.** Tens of thousands of real ball data points - authentic skid, roll, break, and lip-outs. Dial in stimp to match your course.\n\n**Tour-level analytics.** Ball speed, line and miss patterns. Add the mount for face angle, path, tempo, smash factor and impact heat maps. In-headset, web, or mobile.\n\n**Every training aid built in.** Putting arc, alignment laser, tempo line, metronome, putting mirror, tee gates.\n\n**Play a friend.** 1v1 rounds and mini games over ranked multiplayer.\n\n**One price.** No pass, no season ticket, no renewals.\n\nQuestions? Chat with the dev team: https://discord.gg/2SbUnnpCfx", "short_description": "Real putter, real ball, every stroke measured. Putting practice on Meta Quest 3 with no subscription."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Logo.png", "id": "3543613075811708", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824307_3543613082478374_638908712768740982_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7ExNCBQ8ue4Q7kNvwEdDBeS&_nc_oc=AdrcmW0QPlZJxFwXc5ZyOt89SCx1aCN6WdTTiOZKF23FId4MO8Xb6aENvdb6tk0CA4g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQT6e0jSKqAV-A7qj3YegyzYR1el8tGrH54IHsiAEbKjhw&oe=6AF9BF3A"}, {"file_name": "Korean Quest Store - 2560x1440.png", "id": "2026406291329707", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823837_2026406294663040_7189430179496047163_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=NsLMJUhQBSwQ7kNvwHckSAH&_nc_oc=Adr9PACP0ZfbSi4y8ddaVo521TLymEyS_7JqnsWrgDCqOUCUqQVl264HhNQNQymv3PQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSXn9-B_jtht1kj-C5n-8z7Xw3KFzVf9j9xIroQ_OBk9A&oe=6AF9D2D0"}, {"file_name": "Korean Quest Store - 1008x1440.png", "id": "1568265651414352", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw